# Dynamic Programming

Dynamic programming is a extended version of recursion

https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dynamic-programming/


## Problems (easy to hard)

Work top to bottom. Each level adds one new idea on top of the last.

### Level 1 - 1D DP (recursion + memo -> table)
Idea: write the recursion first, add memoization, then convert to a table.

